              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Supercords"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used this recipe today as a starting off point. I added some additional vegetables for flavor and nutrition, but kept the main ingredient as asparagus. (broccoli, kale, peppers, eggplant, and celery)\nI also used some fresh lemon juice with ground cumin and ginger. \n\nThe final result was amazing. My parents loved it too."
